session.goalText:
Too many Projects request Bilko changes

Bilko is a hosting platform, we need to be reducing dependency on us and exposing tools /mcp-s for other sessions-agents to publish and manage their content ;

The /project/ list is a good example of something that must be a Bolko Service for hosting, listing, but the content of the apps / description / links etc should be owned by the publishing project and changed by them as they need; 

This now begs a question on how tdo we ensure that only I can post projects for now. Bilko as framework must enforce the standards

